sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as PortfolioController
    participant Auth as JwtFilter
    participant WS as WalletService
    participant Coin as CoinsService
    participant DB as Database

    C->>API: GET /api/wallet/portfolio
    API->>Auth: validate token
    Auth-->>API: userId
    API->>WS: GetPortfolio(userId)
    WS->>DB: SELECT Wallet, CoinHoldings WHERE userId
    DB-->>WS: wallet + holdings
    WS->>Coin: GetCurrentPrices(list of coinIds)
    Coin-->>WS: current prices
    WS->>WS: compute per-holding currentValue, profit, total
    WS-->>API: portfolio dto
    API-->>C: 200 {holdings, totalValue, totalProfit}
